@organizing
title: Organising workers
subtitle: Campaign in the workplaces with the unions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if investment_adopted == 1; labor_strength += 2

Union shop stewards campaign for us in the factories, hospitals and warehouses.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Argue for the Zukunftsprogramm.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if recession_seen == 0 : There is no economic crisis. ?][? if investment_adopted : The party has already adopted the plan. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and investment_adopted = 0 and recession_seen
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; investment_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 1

We publish studies showing that public investment pays for itself over time. The idea is gaining ground in the party, though Netzwerk Berlin is unconvinced.

